  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Not even getting a chance to let go of your pickaxe, you had been pulled
    into the core as well. Instead of colliding into the mass that had been gathered
    inside, however, you flew past it, seeing only a flash of light. Once the light
    subsided, you realized that you were no longer in your lab. The room you found
    yourself in looked similar, but not quite right. Instead of the exit, there were
    now four rooms, a mysterious glow coming out of them. Curiously, in the place
    the core had supposed to be standing, there now stood an oddity - a red crystal.
    You only had one choice left - explore, and discover.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aa9690349e011964aaa78700753f6328, type: 2}
